cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Solar Decomp: GHI to DNI+DHI solar irradiance decomposition"
abstract: >
  Solar Decomp is an open-source web application for decomposing global
  horizontal irradiance (GHI) into direct normal irradiance (DNI) and
  diffuse horizontal irradiance (DHI) using the DIRINT (Perez et al., 1992)
  and Erbs (Erbs et al., 1982) models. It supports 1-min, 15-min and
  60-min time-series data, includes a physical quality-control system,
  and exports results in CSV, Excel and JSON formats.
